This directory is for containing the edge surfaces extrtacted from the real images in ../RealImages.
The files are too big and have not been uploaded.

The script make_real_edges (which must be moved to the parent directory for running) will create them.
First you should have populated the directory ../RealImages with the input 3D images according to the instructions provided there.

After that, you will have the files
EK_avg_5_beetle.vtk
EK_avg_5_present.vtk 
EK_avg_5_tree.vtk
EK_avg_5_ctheadZ.vtk
EK_avg_5_mrbrainZ.vtk 
and
Sobel_avg_5_present.vtk
Sobel_avg_5_beetle.vtk
Sobel_avg_5_tree.vtk  
Sobel_avg_5_ctheadZ.vtk
Sobel_avg_5_mrbrainZ.vtk
containing the edge surfaces obtained by appling the EK filters and the Sobel filters.
